# "Mutant" is a creature type word in The Cloning of Shredder's rules text (CR 612.2), so a text-changing effect changes what its
# copies are: after chapter I has made a Rat King, Verminister token that is a Mutant, Bot1's Artificial Evolution replaces
# "Mutant" with "Elf" on the Saga (CR 612.1). Chapter II's token copy of the exiled Rat King is then an Elf in addition to its
# other types, not a Mutant (CR 707.9b, 612.2); the first token, already made, stays a Mutant.

